{"message":"The best match is the **Green Fee-Free Account**: you would receive **$20** and your roommate would receive **$35**, for a combined **$55**. Her approximately $600 paycheck exceeds the required **$300 deposit within 60 days**.

Your referral records show one completed referral and one in progress; the completed referral was dated 11/04/2025. Based on the program’s two-bonus rolling 9-day limit, the earlier bonus should no longer count against that limit as of today, though the referral must still be accepted by the system.

Important conditions: she must be a new Rho-Bank customer with no Rho-Bank account—open or closed—within the past 12 months; the deposit must be new money; and the funds must remain for at least 30 days after the qualifying period ends. Referral rewards cannot be combined with another new-account promotion. You and your roommate being registered at different addresses satisfies that restriction."}
